twig-value contains no glibc code. Its iconv converter (src/builtins/string/charset_basic.rs and charset_basic/)
was written without reading glibc's sources, from the charset specifications and from the behaviour of the oracle
observed through PHP and through glibc's public iconv_open()/iconv() interface. glibc's exact iconv is the separate
crate twig-iconv (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Dependencies from crates.io are not part of these sources and carry their own licences. hash('xxh128') uses the
xxhash-rust crate (BSL-1.0), a Rust implementation of xxHash (Yann Collet).


